================================================================================
Coolify service templates
================================================================================

Portions of the app catalog under `catalog/apps/` are derived from the service
templates published by Coolify (coollabs.io).

    Source:    https://github.com/coollabsio/coolify
    File:      templates/service-templates.json
    Copyright: Coolify contributors
    License:   Apache License, Version 2.0
               https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Manifests carrying `"source": "coolify"` were generated from those templates by
`tools/catalog/import-coolify.mjs`. The compose documents were modified: Coolify's
generated-value placeholders (`SERVICE_FQDN_*`, `SERVICE_PASSWORD_*`,
`SERVICE_USER_*`, `SERVICE_BASE64_*` and related forms) were rewritten into plain
Compose variables declared through this project's `envDefaults`, image references
were given explicit tags, and the surrounding metadata was restructured into this
project's manifest schema. The short app descriptions are Coolify's, unmodified.

Coolify is not affiliated with this project and does not endorse it.

